  58:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_pwr.c ****       registers and backup SRAM) is protected against possible unwanted
  59:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_pwr.c ****       write accesses.
